{"suttaId":"thag16.9","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3417,3501],"vripara":"892"},"segments":{"thag16.9:0.4":"Anuruddhattheragāthā","thag16.9:1.1":"“Pahāya mātāpitaro, bhaginī ñātibhātaro;","thag16.9:1.3":"Pañca kāmaguṇe hitvā, anuruddhova jhāyatu.","thag16.9:2.1":"“Sameto naccagītehi, sammatāḷappabodhano;","thag16.9:2.3":"Na tena suddhimajjhagaṃ [suddhamajjhagā (sī. ka.), suddhimajjhagamā (syā.)], mārassa visaye rato.","thag16.9:3.1":"“Etañca samatikkamma, rato buddhassa sāsane;","thag16.9:3.3":"Sabboghaṃ samatikkamma, anuruddhova jhāyati.","thag16.9:4.1":"“Rūpā saddā rasā gandhā, phoṭṭhabbā ca manoramā;","thag16.9:4.3":"Ete ca samatikkamma, anuruddhova jhāyati.","thag16.9:5.1":"“Piṇḍapātapaṭikkanto, eko adutiyo muni;","thag16.9:5.3":"Esati paṃsukūlāni, anuruddho anāsavo.","thag16.9:6.1":"“Vicinī aggahī dhovi, rajayī dhārayī muni;","thag16.9:6.3":"Paṃsukūlāni matimā, anuruddho anāsavo.","thag16.9:7.1":"“Mahiccho ca asantuṭṭho, saṃsaṭṭho yo ca uddhato;","thag16.9:7.3":"Tassa dhammā ime honti, pāpakā saṃkilesikā.","thag16.9:8.1":"“Sato ca hoti appiccho, santuṭṭho avighātavā;","thag16.9:8.3":"Pavivekarato vitto, niccamāraddhavīriyo.","thag16.9:9.1":"“Tassa dhammā ime honti, kusalā bodhipakkhikā;","thag16.9:9.3":"Anāsavo ca so hoti, iti vuttaṃ mahesinā.","thag16.9:10.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya, satthā loke anuttaro;","thag16.9:10.3":"Manomayena kāyena, iddhiyā upasaṅkami.","thag16.9:11.1":"“Yadā me ahu saṅkappo, tato uttari desayi;","thag16.9:11.3":"Nippapañcarato buddho, nippapañcamadesayi.","thag16.9:12.1":"“Tassāhaṃ dhammamaññāya, vihāsiṃ sāsane rato;","thag16.9:12.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thag16.9:13.1":"“Pañcapaññāsavassāni, yato nesajjiko ahaṃ;","thag16.9:13.3":"Pañcavīsativassāni, yato middhaṃ samūhataṃ.","thag16.9:14.1":"[dī. ni.2.222]“Nāhu assāsapassāsā, ṭhitacittassa tādino;","thag16.9:14.3":"Anejo santimārabbha, cakkhumā parinibbuto.","thag16.9:15.1":"[dī. ni.2.222]“Asallīnena cittena, vedanaṃ ajjhavāsayi;","thag16.9:15.3":"Pajjotasseva nibbānaṃ, vimokkho cetaso ahu.","thag16.9:16.1":"“Ete pacchimakā dāni, munino phassapañcamā;","thag16.9:16.3":"Nāññe dhammā bhavissanti, sambuddhe parinibbute.","thag16.9:17.1":"“Natthi dāni punāvāso, devakāyasmi jālini;","thag16.9:17.3":"Vikkhīṇo jātisaṃsāro, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thag16.9:18.1":"“Yassa muhuttena sahassadhā, loko saṃvidito sabrahmakappo;","thag16.9:18.3":"Vasī iddhiguṇe cutūpapāte, kāle passati devatā sa bhikkhu [sabhikkhuno (sī. ka.)].","thag16.9:19.1":"“Annabhāro [annahāro (sī.)] pure āsiṃ, daliddo ghāsahārako;","thag16.9:19.3":"Samaṇaṃ paṭipādesiṃ, upariṭṭhaṃ yasassinaṃ.","thag16.9:20.1":"“Somhi sakyakule jāto, anuruddhoti maṃ vidū;","thag16.9:20.3":"Upeto naccagītehi, sammatāḷappabodhano.","thag16.9:21.1":"“Athaddasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, satthāraṃ akutobhayaṃ;","thag16.9:21.3":"Tasmiṃ cittaṃ pasādetvā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thag16.9:22.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, yattha me vusitaṃ pure;","thag16.9:22.3":"Tāvatiṃsesu devesu, aṭṭhāsiṃ sakkajātiyā [satajātiyā (sī.)].","thag16.9:23.1":"“Sattakkhattuṃ manussindo, ahaṃ rajjamakārayiṃ;","thag16.9:23.3":"Cāturanto vijitāvī, jambusaṇḍassa issaro;","thag16.9:23.5":"Adaṇḍena asatthena, dhammena anusāsayiṃ.","thag16.9:24.1":"“Ito satta tato satta, saṃsārāni catuddasa;","thag16.9:24.3":"Nivāsamabhijānissaṃ, devaloke ṭhitā tadā.","thag16.9:25.1":"“Pañcaṅgike samādhimhi, sante ekodibhāvite;","thag16.9:25.3":"Paṭippassaddhiladdhamhi, dibbacakkhu visujjhi me.","thag16.9:26.1":"“Cutūpapātaṃ jānāmi, sattānaṃ āgatiṃ gatiṃ;","thag16.9:26.3":"Itthabhāvaññathābhāvaṃ, jhāne pañcaṅgike ṭhito.","thag16.9:27.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā … pe … bhavanetti samūhatā.","thag16.9:28.1":"“Vajjīnaṃ veḷuvagāme, ahaṃ jīvitasaṅkhayā;","thag16.9:28.3":"Heṭṭhato veḷugumbasmiṃ, nibbāyissaṃ anāsavo”ti.","thag16.9:28.5":"… Anuruddho thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
